      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, i get the ttl thing now. sorry for being a bit intense, i just got worried lol.\n\nbut it's still just really weird how it feels so... intentional? like, it's not just a delay, it's like the connection is actively playing games with me, jumping back and forth between the old and new servers in a way that doesn't seem like a simple timer. is there any other reason why the network might behave so erratically or \"trick\" a user during this process?",
      "source": "evaluator"
